#
#   window_environment_settings_object - HTML::WindowEnvironmentSettingsObject: the settings
#   object of a Window's realm
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/Scripting/WindowEnvironmentSettingsObject.cpp (lines
#       1-152) and WindowEnvironmentSettingsObject.h (lines 1-39): setting up a window
#       environment settings object (and the realm's [[HostDefined]] with the web intrinsics
#       and the page), and the settings object's algorithms, which answer from the window's
#       associated Document.
